1
00:00:00,553 --> 00:00:05,083
(Sheldon:)Although copyright law would allow me
to quote snippets in the context of a review.

2
00:00:18,871 --> 00:00:20,361
I'm glad you're feeling better.

3
00:00:20,539 --> 00:00:21,799
(Bernadette:)Me too.

4
00:00:21,974 --> 00:00:25,574
But if I'd known we were gonna be dancing,
I would've wore my flats.

5
00:00:27,213 --> 00:00:30,483
- Well, this turned out pretty well, huh?
- Yeah, I think so.

6
00:00:30,649 --> 00:00:34,849
(Raj:)I agree. That is, if you've never
been to or heard of a party before.

7
00:00:36,789 --> 00:00:40,159
(Amy:)If you'd let me pierce your brain
with a hot needle in the right place...

8
00:00:40,359 --> 00:00:42,419
(Amy:)...you'd be happy all the time.

9
00:00:45,631 --> 00:00:50,121
Penny, I have a couple of questions
about your closet.

10
00:00:50,302 --> 00:00:54,242
(Sheldon:)Is there any reason
you're keeping this dead goldfish?

11
00:00:55,007 --> 00:00:57,877
(Penny:)Damn, I forgot to feed him.

12
00:00:58,744 --> 00:01:00,614
(Penny:)And that I had him.

13
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:04,410
(Sheldon:)Well, now, did you also have a dog?

14
00:01:04,583 --> 00:01:08,683
(Sheldon:)Because I found what appears to be
a battery-operated chew toy...

15
00:01:08,888 --> 00:01:11,448
(Penny:)Party's over! Party's over!

